de'i li 03 pi'e 08 pi'e 2008 la'o fy. Fiat Knox .fy. cusku zoi skamyxatra.
> Is there a standard way of telling times, dates and similar
> in Lojban?
> 
> Specifically, is there a standard accepted by this group as
> the "default" way of saying "It's the seventeenth of September?"
.skamyxatra

I believe that you simply use "{detri}" or "{tcika}" with the date in x1,
optionally modified by the tense marker "{ca}."  For your example, this would
be "{li paze pi'e so ca detri}."

mu'omi'e la'o gy. Minimiscience .gy.

